ctable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>…</mo><mo>,</mo><mi>k</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></span>.</p>","file":"ch08-eigenvalues/01-invariant-subspaces.html"}